By the Pictogrammers icon group and Material Design Icons contributors.

The SVG path geometry in this directory was verified against upstream revision
2424e748e0cc63ab7b9c095a099b9fe239b737c0. Original icon names and source URLs are
listed in sources.json. The Apache License, Version 2.0 and upstream license
summary are included as LICENSE and UPSTREAM-LICENSE.

Local modifications: filenames map to device types; width and height are set
to 24 pixels; CSS selects foreground colours for light and dark browser themes.
SPDX license comments were added. No SVG path geometry was changed.
